/target
/**/target
Cargo.lock.bak
*.swp
.DS_Store
/.claude/
/.worktrees/

# Stray rustc artifact occasionally emitted at repo root by certain build
# flows (e.g. some IDE-driven `rustc --emit=metadata` runs).
*.rmeta

# insta snapshot review artifacts (pending approval).
*.snap.new

# Repo-local Cairn runtime state (model cache, vault scratch). Both the
# repo root and any nested working directory may accumulate `.cairn/`
# trees from running the CLI / tests inside the workspace; ignore them
# all to keep DB/WAL/SHM artifacts out of commits.
.cairn/

# Vault scaffold artifacts that the CLI drops into CWD when run outside
# a real vault (e.g. test runs that resolve CWD as the vault root).
/index.md
/log.md
/purpose.md
crates/**/index.md
crates/**/log.md
crates/**/purpose.md
